r overnight.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Heat soaked beans in same water to boiling. Cover and simmer 1 to 2 hours. Drain, reserving liquid.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Layer onion, pork and cooked beans in a dutch over.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Mix brown sugar, molasses, salt, mustard, pepper, and tomato sauce with reserved liquid.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Pour over beans. Add water to almost cover beans, if</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">necessary. Cover and bake at 350 for 3 hours; stir occassionally. Uncover and bake to desired consistency.</li> </ol> <div class=\"ERSClear\"></div> </div> <div class=\"endeasyrecipe\" title=\"style002\" style=\"display: none\">3.5.3226</div> </div><br />\n </p>\n"
